gend-of-etheria", "storyline": "Centuries ago, the world of Etheria was torn apart by The Sundering, a failed magical ritual that unleashed Raveren\u2014a cosmic entity of entropy that devours reality itself. Now, the land is fractured, corrupted by the Aether-Rot: a creeping decay that erodes stone, warps life, and steals memory.\n\nYou are Kaelen (or Lyra), a lone wanderer gifted with Aether-Sense\u2014an uncanny ability to perceive magic and its corruption. While others forget, you remember everything. Haunted by loss and driven by a need for truth, you uncover a forgotten Memory-Core Shard deep beneath the ruins of the Sunken Spires. What you learn could unravel the world\u2014or save it.", "summary": "Raveren: The Legend of Etheria\n\nA dark fantasy RPG where memory is your greatest weapon\u2014and your deepest curse.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/raveren-the-legend-of-etheria"}